<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on SBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on SBC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it had issued five million American-style call warrants on Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    275.00 CHF		PREMIUM	17.28 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.40 CHF		  GEARING	10.60 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.FEB.97-21.JAN.00   PAYDATE	13.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  255.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
